<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten feed pellets unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten feed pellets unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. corn gluten feed prices</p>
<p>were unchanged Monday. There were no meal quotes from Chicago</p>
<p>because a seasonal drop in corn syrup production has reduced</p>
<p>gluten production this fall, dealers said..</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -  100.00    100.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -  100.00    100.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  350.00    unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
